    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from scratch, grow your garden center into a thriving business. Begin with the basics, expand your plant selection, design your layout, and turn your humble shop into a flourishing business\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.poster.avif?t=1750742941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.webm?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.mp4?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your Stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking supply crates can save floor space and keep your store organized\u2014but be careful and don\u2019t go overboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.poster.avif?t=1750742941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.webm?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.mp4?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Promote your Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw in more customers by using a mix of promotional strategies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.poster.avif?t=1750742941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.webm?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.mp4?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add new Stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise any free space and add in shelves and plant stock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.poster.avif?t=1750742941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.webm?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.mp4?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing in first person :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >purchase infrastructure and design a layout for your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy plants and other items and arrange on suitable shelves and tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >expand the store floor space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perform daily store operations like restocking shelves and operating cash registers to keep your business running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >add staff to perform tasks as your business grows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage the finances and monitor customer ratings to increase customer numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage stock replenishment whilst considering supplier and competitor dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decorate and choose flooring that meets your taste</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from scratch, grow your garden center into a thriving business. Begin with the basics, expand your plant selection, design your layout, and turn your humble shop into a flourishing business\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.poster.avif?t=1750742941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.webm?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.mp4?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your Stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking supply crates can save floor space and keep your store organized\u2014but be careful and don\u2019t go overboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.poster.avif?t=1750742941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.webm?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.mp4?t=1750742941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Promote your Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw in more customers by using a mix of promotional strategies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.ak